---
import { muffinTinPartition } from '../../../data/part04/ch16TeachingModels.mjs';
const defaults = { cellWidth: 10, cellHeight: 6, radius: 1 };
const centres = [[2.5, 3], [5, 3], [7.5, 3]];
const initial = muffinTinPartition({ ...defaults, centres });
---

<figure class="chapter-visual muffin-tin-partition" id="ch16-muffin-tin-partition">
  <figcaption><strong>原创交互模型：sphere/interstitial 分区</strong><span lang="en">Original interactive model: sphere/interstitial partition</span></figcaption>
  <div class="chapter-visual__controls"><label>sphere radius R<input data-mt-radius type="range" min="0.5" max="1.15" step="0.05" value="1" /><output data-mt-radius-output>1.00</output></label></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 660 410" role="img" aria-label="Three nonoverlapping spheres inside a rectangular teaching cell">
    <rect class="mt-cell" x="30" y="25" width="600" height="360" rx="8" />
    {centres.map(([x, y], index) => <g><circle class="mt-sphere" data-mt-circle cx={30 + 60 * x} cy={25 + 60 * y} r="60" /><text x={30 + 60 * x} y={30 + 60 * y} text-anchor="middle">site {index + 1}</text></g>)}
    <text x="330" y="405" text-anchor="middle">2D teaching surrogate; not an ASA volume</text>
  </svg>
  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>sphere fraction=<output data-mt-sphere-fraction>{initial.sphereFraction.toFixed(4)}</output></span>
    <span>interstitial fraction=<output data-mt-interstitial>{initial.interstitialFraction.toFixed(4)}</output></span>
    <span>nearest gap=<output data-mt-gap>{initial.nearestGap.toFixed(3)}</output></span>
  </div>
  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>固定二维 cell 中三个等半径、nonoverlapping circles。</p><p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> three equal nonoverlapping circles in a fixed two-dimensional cell.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>sphere/interstitial fractions 之和为 1；R 增大时 sphere fraction 增大、nearest gap 减小。</p><p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the two fractions sum to one; increasing R increases the sphere fraction and decreases the nearest gap.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该图不代表真实 Voronoi/ASA volume、potential、basis completeness 或 all-electron reconstruction。</p><p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the figure is not a real Voronoi or ASA volume, potential, basis-completeness, or all-electron model.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>无 JavaScript fallback：静态图使用 R=1.00，并保留 fractions 与 gap。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  import { muffinTinPartition } from '../../../data/part04/ch16TeachingModels.mjs';
  const root = document.getElementById('ch16-muffin-tin-partition');
  if (root) {
    const control = root.querySelector('[data-mt-radius]');
    const outputs = { radius: root.querySelector('[data-mt-radius-output]'), sphere: root.querySelector('[data-mt-sphere-fraction]'), interstitial: root.querySelector('[data-mt-interstitial]'), gap: root.querySelector('[data-mt-gap]') };
    const circles = [...root.querySelectorAll('[data-mt-circle]')];
    if (control instanceof HTMLInputElement) {
      const update = () => {
        const radius = Number(control.value), result = muffinTinPartition({ cellWidth: 10, cellHeight: 6, radius, centres: [[2.5, 3], [5, 3], [7.5, 3]] });
        circles.forEach((circle) => circle.setAttribute('r', String(60 * radius)));
        if (outputs.radius instanceof HTMLOutputElement) outputs.radius.value = radius.toFixed(2);
        if (outputs.sphere instanceof HTMLOutputElement) outputs.sphere.value = result.sphereFraction.toFixed(4);
        if (outputs.interstitial instanceof HTMLOutputElement) outputs.interstitial.value = result.interstitialFraction.toFixed(4);
        if (outputs.gap instanceof HTMLOutputElement) outputs.gap.value = result.nearestGap.toFixed(3);
      };
      control.addEventListener('input', update); update();
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .muffin-tin-partition input,.muffin-tin-partition svg{width:100%}.muffin-tin-partition label{display:grid;gap:.35rem}.mt-cell{fill:var(--sl-color-gray-6);stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2}.mt-sphere{fill:color-mix(in srgb,var(--sl-color-accent) 24%,transparent);stroke:var(--sl-color-accent-high);stroke-width:2.5}.muffin-tin-partition svg text{fill:currentColor;font-size:13px}
</style>
